# Cloudflare Workers static assets: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
# No long `immutable` rule for /_next/static/*: Cloudflare would send it on
# a 404 for a missing chunk too, and browsers would keep that 404 for a year.
# The default (max-age=0, must-revalidate, with an ETag) costs only free
# revalidation requests.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'

# The release check reads this right after a deploy.
/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store, must-revalidate

# The next upload reads it to carry this release's chunks (scripts/carry-static.mjs).
/release-assets.json
  Cache-Control: no-store, must-revalidate
